#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-9434 expect=skipped domain=DM
# Rule:Description: CDISC-SEND-9434 — the Required key SETCD is not populated.
#note "SETCD is absent from DM, so Requirements.Variables.All gates the rule to SKIPPED rather than firing on every row. This is the absent-column guard the standing 'absent column = all-missing column' policy makes necessary: without it empty(SETCD) would be true on every row of every dataset that simply lacks the column. Asserts the SKIP, not merely the absence of a finding."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset DM
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SEX type=Char
---
S1      | DM     | S1-001  | M
---
